Players Committee card image of [[Han's Heavy Blaster Pistol (V)]] (original printing), game text: “Deploy on Han (except TK-422), even as a 'react.' May target a character or creature for free. Draw destiny. Target hit, its forfeit = 0, and opponent loses 1 Force if destiny +1 > defense value. Once during your control phase, may fire using 1 Force.”

Source: <code>Images-HT/starwars/Virtual0-Light/large/hansheavyblasterpistol.gif</code> in the Players Committee's Holotable image repository, version of commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/022435b7929e4de26dafbcb1de2ec1d6d04d2153 022435b] (8 July 2018). The PC serves its card images from this repository at res.starwarsccg.org; this is the earlier version of that file.

Edits: none. The repository's bytes are uploaded unchanged.

